          "say": "A man at the foot of the path, holding a gold pan across his chest like a shield.",
          "repeat": [
            "His boots are new, his hat is new, and his eyes haven't closed since spring.",
            "He's richer than anybody in Consolation, and he looks like it's keeping him up at night."
          ]
        }
      ],
      "LISTEN_TO": [
        {
          "say": "Breathing through his nose, on purpose.",
          "repeat": [
            "His pan, tapping against a button.",
